From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] qcap: RenderStream finds its source as Windows does, and renders VBI pins (6516)

ICaptureGraphBuilder2::RenderStream returned E_NOTIMPL for
PIN_CATEGORY_VBI and searched for the pin to render depth first. It
now looks breadth first (a filter's own unconnected outputs, then the
filters its connected outputs lead to), does not follow connected
pins for a category, returns E_FAIL when everything is connected and
S_OK when nothing has the media type, maps a source that cannot reach
the intermediate filter to E_FAIL, renders a lone preview pin, and
connects VBI pins directly (there is no Tee/Sink-to-Sink converter).
28 todo_wine marks of the render stream tests removed.
---
